  "definition": "Revised Monitoring Frequency for VOC Contaminants",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-01-01",
  "historyNote": "#9700, eff 5-1-10; amd by #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19 (formerly Env-Dw 712.04)",
